  {
   "id": "U54osGTrA7sJ",
   "from": "Jonathan Rosenblatt",
   "author": "a305e65fa9dfb74d",
   "date": "2010-05-11T05:56:52Z",
   "subject": "Re: ועוד אתגר",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">אתה צודק. אבל בדומה לעבודה על וקטור, כדאי להכריז על גודל הרשימה לפני התחלת איטרציות משיקולי זמן. הנה דוגמה (וגם תשובה לשאלה):<br></div><div><br>reps&lt;- 100000<br>save.1&lt;- function(replications){<br>\r\n\r\n  .result&lt;- vector(&#39;list&#39;, length=replications)<br>  for (i in 1:replications){ .result[i]&lt;-rnorm(1)}<br>return(.result)<br>}<br><br>system.time(save.1(reps))<br><br>save.2&lt;- function(replications){<br>  .result&lt;- list()<br>\r\n\r\n  for (i in 1:replications){ .result[i]&lt;-rnorm(1) }<br>return(.result)<br>} <br><br>system.time(save.2(reps))<br><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2010/5/10 Yizhar Toren <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yto...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-right:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">ריקה באיזה מובן?<br>\r\n\r\nאם הכוונה היא ל NULL אז השאלה נראית לי קצת מיותרת - רשימה היא טיפוס דינמי ולכן אין ממש משמעות על ההכרזה עליה מראש באורך מסויים. פשוט אוספים את התוצאות בצורה דינאמית:<br><br>\r\n</div><div>my_list = list()<br><br>for (i in 1:N) {<br><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">my_list[[i]] = ...<br></div>}<br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br>או שלא הבנתי נכון את השאלה...<br><br></div><div><div><span style=\"color:black\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Yizhar (Izzy) Toren</span><br>Tel: 052-5562470<br><span style=\"font-family:arial narrow,sans-serif\"><a style=\"color:rgb(0,0,102);font-family:garamond,serif\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yto...@gmail.com</a><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></div><div style=\"padding:5px 0pt;font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3px\"><a href=\"http://il.linkedin.com/in/ytoren\" style=\"padding:0pt 2px;color:blue;font-size:10pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://il.linkedin.com/in/ytoren&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498954308000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PEYckxxTNmKxhMw_qT-qv\"><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/gLQOeMsMNebdSFUKAv6S2L7OOQMGotVNjBhHR6xLrn96HC1Er_eyqPVpOnk26Ib1dC2WrpzOjBhbwXVCVxKP=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.images.wisestamp.com/linkedin.png\" alt=\"Linkedin\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;padding-bottom:5px\" border=\"0\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\"></a><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/ytoren\" style=\"padding:0pt 2px;color:blue;font-size:10pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.facebook.com/ytoren&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498954309000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wl4jh44WI1F7u4j9UXiiw\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/iVR26SMNnIZrZD8S7pVj1anQI5GLCxGFr3A5_xKUDSr8N0AxPkvvuEmarenQaHjBN_Aqh16zPdkPfm5tJZb2=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.images.wisestamp.com/facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;padding-bottom:5px\" border=\"0\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\"></a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></span><br><br></div><div><div></div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, May 10, 2010 at 6:04 PM, Jonathan Rosenblatt <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">john...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-right:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">אתה אוהב להתחכם אהה...<br>בסדר. <br><br>אז איך יוצרים רשימה ריקה ובה 10 תאים?<br><br><br></div><div><div></div><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, May 10, 2010 at 5:42 PM, Yizhar Toren <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yto...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">list.files(pattern = &#39;raw&#39;) <br><br>if you want to do the same for a different directory<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>list.files(path = &quot;c:\\\\path\\\\to\\\\data\\\\&quot;, pattern = &quot;raw&quot;)<br><br>the parameter &quot;pattern&quot; is a regular expression so you can use its for a much more clever matching scheme:<br>\r\n<br>file that start with &quot;raw&quot;: pattern = &quot;^raw&quot;<br>files that end with &quot;raw&quot;: pattern = &quot;raw$&quot;<br>etc....<br><br><br><br><span style=\"color:black\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Yizhar (Izzy) Toren</span><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTel: 052-5562470<br><span style=\"font-family:arial narrow